  "text": "Here is the essential shortcut cheat sheet every modern professional should know by heart. Spending your day clicking toolbar icons for search, undo, and window navigation destroys your efficiency. Visual searching across cluttered software interfaces drains cognitive stamina and creates unnecessary mental friction. Learn Control-F to locate phrases, Control-Z to reverse mistakes, and Windows-D to reveal your desktop instantly. This simple muscle memory saves hours each week.",
